spoke English with my brother and with me.

00:00:44.135 --> 00:00:46.864
So I hadn heard German,
but I couldn't speak it.

00:00:47.465 --> 00:00:51.754
Then I worked on a German ship for
two weeks hitchhiking over to Europe.

00:00:52.325 --> 00:00:54.875
Uh, I hitchhiked around in Germany.

00:00:54.875 --> 00:00:58.324
I even worked for two weeks on
a construction site in Vienna.

00:00:58.605 --> 00:01:01.905
So I had some use of German,
but it was very rudimentary.

00:01:02.475 --> 00:01:05.445
So in 1987, I was between jobs.

00:01:05.445 --> 00:01:10.575
I had a month off between jobs and I said,
you know, I really want to learn German.

00:01:11.085 --> 00:01:14.145
And I had, you know, prior to getting
on that German boat, I'd looked

00:01:14.445 --> 00:01:17.065
